### ============================================================
### AI 对话 & 模型管理 API
### 基础 URL: http://localhost:9000
### ============================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:9000

### ============================================================
### 0. 【必须先执行】登录获取 Token
###    执行后 {{Login.response.body.$.data.accessToken}} 即为后续请求的 Bearer Token
### ============================================================

# @name Login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "vben",
  "password": "123456",
  "captchaKey": "",
  "captcha": ""
}


### ============================================================
### AI 对话（Chat Demo）
### ============================================================

### 1. 获取可用平台列表
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/chat/platforms
Authorization: Bearer {{Login.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}

### 2. 获取平台默认模型
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/chat/default-model?platform=SILICON_FLOW
Authorization: Bearer {{Login.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}

### 3. 普通对话
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/chat/send
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{Login.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}

{
  "platform": "SILICON_FLOW",
  "model": "Qwen/Qwen3.5-397B-A17B",
  "prompt": "请用通俗易懂的语言解释一下什么是绝对值"
}

### 4. 带记忆的对话
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/chat/send/with-memory?sessionId=student-1-session
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{Login.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}

{
  "platform": "SILICON_FLOW",
  "prompt": "我刚才问了什么问题？"
}

### 5. 流式对话
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/chat/send/stream
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{Login.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}

{
  "platform": "SILICON_FLOW",
  "prompt": "介绍一下一元二次方程的解法"
}

### ============================================================
### AI 平台管理（AiPlatform）
### ============================================================

### 6. 分页查询平台
GET {{baseUrl}}/ai/platform/page?pageNum=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{Login.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}

### 7. 查询已启用平台
GET {{baseUrl}}/ai/platform/enabled
Authorization: Bearer {{Login.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}

### 8. 获取平台下拉选项
GET {{baseUrl}}/ai/platform/options
Authorization: Bearer {{Login.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}

### 9. 获取平台详情
GET {{baseUrl}}/ai/platform/1
Authorization: Bearer {{Login.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}

### 10. 按编码获取平台
GET {{baseUrl}}/ai/platform/code/SILICON_FLOW
Authorization: Bearer {{Login.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}

### 11. 获取默认平台
GET {{baseUrl}}/ai/platform/default
Authorization: Bearer {{Login.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}

### 12. 设置默认平台
PUT {{baseUrl}}/ai/platform/1/default
Authorization: Bearer {{Login.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}

### 13. 重新加载平台配置
POST {{baseUrl}}/ai/platform/reload
Authorization: Bearer {{Login.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}

### ============================================================
### AI 模型管理（AiModel）
### ============================================================

### 14. 分页查询模型
GET {{baseUrl}}/ai/model/page?pageNum=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{Login.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}

### 15. 按平台 ID 查询模型
GET {{baseUrl}}/ai/model/platform/1
Authorization: Bearer {{Login.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}

### 16. 按平台编码查询模型
GET {{baseUrl}}/ai/model/platform/by-code/SILICON_FLOW
Authorization: Bearer {{Login.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}

### 17. 获取模型下拉选项
GET {{baseUrl}}/ai/model/options?platformId=1
Authorization: Bearer {{Login.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}

### 18. 获取模型详情
GET {{baseUrl}}/ai/model/1
Authorization: Bearer {{Login.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}

### 19. 获取平台默认模型
GET {{baseUrl}}/ai/model/platform/1/default
Authorization: Bearer {{Login.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}

### 20. 设置默认模型
PUT {{baseUrl}}/ai/model/1/default
Authorization: Bearer {{Login.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}
